            "line_count": 5,
            "preview": "// ofTaiSeconds normalises a negative nano adjustment: -1194 nanos rolls the // second back by one (to -3114) and leaves 999_998_806 nanos within that second. TaiInstant original = TaiInstant.ofTaiSeconds(-3113L, -1194L);"
          },
          {
            "start_line": 26,
            "end_line": 29,
            "line_count": 4,
            "preview": "// Replacing the nanos with 0 keeps the same seconds but resets the fraction. TaiInstant withZeroNanos = original.withNano(0); assertEquals(-3114L, withZeroNanos.getTaiSeconds());"
          },
          {
            "start_line": 31,
            "end_line": 33,
            "line_count": 3,
            "preview": "// The two instants differ only in their nanos, so they are not equal either way. assertFalse(withZeroNanos.equals(original)); assertFalse(original.equals(withZeroNanos));"
          }
